<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS9.SSS3" title="In A.9 Details of Benchmarks Cleaning ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ OptiMind: Teaching LLMs to Think Like Optimization Experts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9.3 </span>Integral vs Fractional Variables</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS9.SSS4" title="In A.9 Details of Benchmarks Cleaning ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ OptiMind: Teaching LLMs to Think Like Optimization Experts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9.4 </span>Wrong Solutions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS9.SSS5" title="In A.9 Details of Benchmarks Cleaning ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ OptiMind: Teaching LLMs to Think Like Optimization Experts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9.5 </span>Infeasible Problems</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS9.SSS6" title="In A.9 Details of Benchmarks Cleaning ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ OptiMind: Teaching LLMs to Think Like Optimization Experts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9.6 </span>Out-of-Scope Problems</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
