<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">OptiMind: Teaching LLMs to Think Like Optimization Experts</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zeyi Chen<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗†</span></sup>
