<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><sup id="id19" class="ltx_sup">1</sup> Microsoft Research  <sup id="id20" class="ltx_sup">2</sup> University of Washington  <sup id="id21" class="ltx_sup">3</sup> Stanford University

</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
